##### ignored-error-message
=== make; echo "status $?"
--- status 0
--- stdout
next
status 0
--- stderr
make: [Makefile:2: all] Error 5 (ignored)

=== files
Makefile: "all:\n\t-@exit 5\n\t@echo next\n"
##### ignore-and-keep-going
=== make -i -k; echo "status $?"
--- status 0
--- stdout
b
all
status 0
--- stderr
make: [Makefile:2: a] Error 1 (ignored)

=== files
Makefile: "all: a b ; @echo all\na: ; @exit 1\nb: ; @echo b\n"
##### stop-on-first-goal
=== make a b; echo "status $?"
--- status 0
--- stdout
status 2
--- stderr
make: *** [Makefile:1: a] Error 1

=== files
Makefile: "a: ; @exit 1\nb: ; @echo b\n"
##### error-function-status
=== make; echo "status $?"
--- status 0
--- stdout
status 2
--- stderr
Makefile:2: *** MISSING is not set.  Stop.

=== make MISSING=1; echo "status $?"
--- status 0
--- stdout
should not run
status 0
--- stderr

=== files
Makefile: "all: ; @echo should not run\n$(if $(MISSING),,$(error MISSING is not set))\n"
##### circular-chain
=== make
--- status 0
--- stdout
c
b
a
--- stderr
make: Circular c <- a dependency dropped.

=== files
Makefile: "a: b ; @echo a\nb: c ; @echo b\nc: a ; @echo c\n"
##### empty-variable-name
=== make; echo "status $?"
--- status 0
--- stdout
status 2
--- stderr
Makefile:1: *** empty variable name.  Stop.

=== files
Makefile: " = value\nall: ;\n"
